packages/parapet-triage/src/parapet_triage/data/hlp_set_performance.yaml

  The 80 heuristic linguistic patterns in this file are transcribed from the
  data package for:

    Y. Zhao, L. Xiao and S. Wong, "A Platform-Agnostic Framework for
    Automatically Identifying Performance Issue Reports With Heuristic
    Linguistic Patterns," IEEE Transactions on Software Engineering,
    50(7):1704-1725, 2024. doi:10.1109/TSE.2024.3390623

  Data package: doi:10.5281/zenodo.10944186
