  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  The pattern names, categories and definitions are reproduced from that
  package. The compiled matcher implementations are original work licensed
  under Apache-2.0 with the rest of PARAPET.

packages/parapet-scope/src/parapet_scope/data/change_scope_codebook.yaml

  The root-cause, optimization-level, design-level pattern and
  test/production co-change code books are transcribed from the data
  package for:

    Y. Zhao, L. Xiao, A. B. Bondi, B. Chen and Y. Liu, "A Large-Scale
    Empirical Study of Real-Life Performance Issues in Open Source
    Projects," IEEE Transactions on Software Engineering, 49(2):924-946,
    2023. doi:10.1109/TSE.2022.3167628

